They are Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation under the MIT License in LICENSE
beside them. The worker only compiles against them: it loads the runtime
library at run time with dlopen and asks for ORT_API_VERSION (31), so any
ONNX Runtime 1.31 or newer works. To update, copy the same three files from a
newer release, update this note and macos/onnxruntime.json together.
